{% doc %}
  @prompt
    create a hero section banner in which we can have a background photo and in that provide a on and off button in th e admin to start the slider or off it and a header text and its all setting to adjust the font size and style and for all the header and discription and a ctr button and adjust the backgound of hte button and its size and color and border and font style it should also have the dot slider at the end  in the bottom only oif the slider button is on , why the image is not coming properly , the backgound image will be 2000*500, replace the banner background size to 2000*700
